WEBVTT

00:00:03.158 --> 00:00:04.115
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:00:09.816 --> 00:00:11.644
So where do you think
our friends are?

00:00:11.688 --> 00:00:15.474
If I had to guess,
I'd say in a Bergen's stomach.

00:00:15.518 --> 00:00:17.215
Could you try to be positive?

00:00:17.259 --> 00:00:19.261
Just once.
You might like it.

00:00:19.304 --> 00:00:21.611
Okay. I'm sure
they're not only alive...

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.788
but about to be delivered
to us on a silver platter.

00:00:24.831 --> 00:00:27.138
[SIGHS] Thank you.
That wasn't so hard, was it?

00:00:28.313 --> 00:00:29.401
[CHIMES]

00:00:29.445 --> 00:00:30.750
[GASPS] Branch!

00:00:30.794 --> 00:00:32.491
Hug time? Seriously?[SHUSHING]

00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:33.710
Listen.

00:00:34.624 --> 00:00:36.016
[FLOWERS CHIMING]

00:00:38.889 --> 00:00:41.239
This is gonna be
the best Trollstice ever!

00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:43.807
Such a great idea I had.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.809
CHEF: Yes. Tomorrow is
Trollstice, everyone.

00:00:45.852 --> 00:00:47.071
And it must be perfect!

00:00:47.115 --> 00:00:48.464
ALL: Yes, Chef!

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:51.684
Feels great to be ordering
everyone around again.

00:00:51.728 --> 00:00:52.946
Branch, look!

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.383
They're alive?

00:00:54.426 --> 00:00:56.776
And on a silver platter, too.
We were both right.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.039
And to mark the occasion,
Your Highness, look.

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:01.651
I found your old Troll bib.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.174
KING GRISTLE: Oh, wow!
I bet you still fit.

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:06.786
[STRAINING]

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.484
[RASPY] Like a glove!

00:01:08.527 --> 00:01:10.050
[GROANS]Ahh...

00:01:10.094 --> 00:01:11.530
[LAUGHS]TROLLS: Shh.

00:01:12.401 --> 00:01:13.706
Oh, you think that's funny?

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.055
We'll see who's laughing

00:01:15.099 --> 00:01:16.535
when I bite
your yummy head off.

00:01:16.579 --> 00:01:18.711
When I bite all y'alls
yummy heads off.

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:21.453
Wait a minute.

00:01:21.497 --> 00:01:23.499
Chef, this isn't
enough yummy heads

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:25.849
to feed all of Bergen Town.

00:01:25.892 --> 00:01:27.503
How are we supposed
to have Trollstice

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.331
if there's not enough Trolls?

00:01:29.374 --> 00:01:31.507
Oh, there's plenty more
where that came from, sire.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:33.030
KING GRISTLE: Are you sure?

00:01:33.073 --> 00:01:34.205
Because I promised
everyone a Troll.

00:01:34.249 --> 00:01:35.511
CHEF: No, no, no, sire!

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:37.034
Everything will be fine.

00:01:37.077 --> 00:01:38.731
If I were truly worried...

00:01:38.775 --> 00:01:41.038
would I be willing
to do this?

00:01:41.081 --> 00:01:42.082
Creek!

00:01:44.084 --> 00:01:45.651
[GASPING]

00:01:45.695 --> 00:01:47.044
Oh, my first Troll!

00:01:47.087 --> 00:01:49.351
Go on, eat,
King Gristle.

00:01:49.394 --> 00:01:52.397
Enjoy a taste
of true happiness.

00:01:56.401 --> 00:01:57.533
[WHIMPERING]

00:01:57.576 --> 00:01:59.012
[TROLLS SHUDDERING]

00:01:59.056 --> 00:02:00.666
Shouldn't we wait
for Trollstice?

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:02.146
TROLLS: Phew.

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:05.105
Sire, every day is Trollstice
when you have Trolls.

00:02:09.371 --> 00:02:10.763
Yeah, I guess.

00:02:12.548 --> 00:02:13.897
[SHUDDERING]

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.247
But my dad said the first time
should be special.

00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:18.380
[TROLLS SIGHING]

00:02:18.423 --> 00:02:20.425
Well, you're the king now.[CREEK GROANING]

00:02:20.469 --> 00:02:22.427
Yeah, I am the king.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.518
But I think
I should share this moment

00:02:26.562 --> 00:02:28.564
with all the kingdom.

00:02:28.607 --> 00:02:30.348
[GRUNTS] Eat it![TROLLS GASPING]

00:02:30.392 --> 00:02:31.436
Mmm.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:32.742
Oh, my God!No!

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:33.786
Yes!

00:02:34.613 --> 00:02:36.267
[PLAYING MARIACHI MUSIC]

00:02:37.094 --> 00:02:38.269
[CHOKING]

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.923
Mmm.

00:02:39.966 --> 00:02:42.534
Idget, lock these Trolls
in your room

00:02:42.578 --> 00:02:44.449
and guard them
with your life.

00:02:46.016 --> 00:02:47.104
Yes, Chef.

00:02:47.147 --> 00:02:48.279
[KING GRISTLE MOANING]

00:02:48.323 --> 00:02:49.411
Yes. Yes, I know.

00:02:49.454 --> 00:02:50.716
Branch, we have to save him!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.588
Save him from what?
His stomach?

00:02:52.631 --> 00:02:54.154
We didn't see him chew.
We didn't see him swallow!

00:02:54.198 --> 00:02:55.591
Face it, Poppy.

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:56.766
Sometimes people go
into other people's mouths...

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.246
and they don't come out.

00:02:58.289 --> 00:03:01.161
If we go after Creek now,
we're going to get eaten.

00:03:01.205 --> 00:03:02.424
I'm sorry...

00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:04.077
but it's too late for him.

00:03:04.121 --> 00:03:05.122
KING GRISTLE: Mmm-mmm-mmm.

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:12.825
Huh. Poppy!

00:03:12.869 --> 00:03:13.957
[GRUNTING]

00:03:22.661 --> 00:03:23.662
[GRUNTING]

00:03:40.897 --> 00:03:42.855
CHEF: Scullery maid![GASPS]

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.641
[GROANING]

00:03:45.684 --> 00:03:48.470
CHEF: Wash these pots
and pans for Trollstice.

00:03:48.513 --> 00:03:50.472
The king's
inviting everyone.

00:03:50.515 --> 00:03:51.864
Except you.

00:03:53.475 --> 00:03:54.824
[SOBBING]

00:04:13.538 --> 00:04:18.761
♪ I've been alone
with you inside my mind

00:04:21.372 --> 00:04:24.941
♪ And in my dreams
I've kissed your lips

00:04:25.724 --> 00:04:29.206
♪ A thousand times

00:04:29.249 --> 00:04:34.733
♪ I sometimes see you
pass outside my door

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:38.041
♪ Hello

00:04:40.391 --> 00:04:44.917
♪ Is it me you're looking for?

00:04:44.961 --> 00:04:48.486
♪ I can see it in your eyes

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:51.707
♪ I can see it in your smile

00:04:53.056 --> 00:04:56.538
♪ You're all I've ever wanted

00:04:56.581 --> 00:05:00.411
♪ And my arms are open wide

00:05:00.455 --> 00:05:02.413
♪ 'Cause you know
just what to say

00:05:02.457 --> 00:05:04.676
You're all the idiots!
I have to do
everything myself.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.635
♪ And you know
just what to do

00:05:06.678 --> 00:05:08.288
I have to get out of bed,

00:05:08.332 --> 00:05:09.725
I'm supposed to
put my own clothes on,
tie my own shoes.

00:05:09.768 --> 00:05:11.379
♪ And I want to
tell you so much

00:05:14.077 --> 00:05:15.774
♪ I love you

00:05:18.168 --> 00:05:20.126
[SOBBING]

00:05:24.304 --> 00:05:25.480
[SNORING]

00:05:28.787 --> 00:05:30.528
Oh, she's in love
with the king.

00:05:30.572 --> 00:05:33.531
What are you talking about?
Bergens don't have feelings.

00:05:33.575 --> 00:05:35.707
Well, maybe you don't know
everything about the Bergens.

00:05:35.751 --> 00:05:37.143
Now let's go.

00:05:43.628 --> 00:05:45.543
Guys!ALL: Poppy!

00:05:45.587 --> 00:05:48.938
ALL: ♪ Celebrate good times,
come on

00:05:48.981 --> 00:05:51.244
♪ It's a celebration

00:05:51.288 --> 00:05:52.942
[SHUSHING]

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:55.597
♪ There's a party going on
right here ♪

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.469
No! There is not a party
going on right here.

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:02.778
The sooner
we get you guys
out of here...

00:06:02.821 --> 00:06:04.475
The sooner
we can save Creek!

00:06:04.519 --> 00:06:06.085
What?[GASPS]

00:06:06.129 --> 00:06:07.304
Hello?

00:06:07.347 --> 00:06:08.827
[ALL GASPING]

00:06:08.871 --> 00:06:11.264
Is it me you're looking for?

00:06:11.308 --> 00:06:13.092
[SNORING]ALL: Phew...

00:06:13.136 --> 00:06:14.137
I know you're looking
for the cupcakes

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.355
and rainbows here...

00:06:15.399 --> 00:06:17.096
but let's face it,
Creek's been eaten.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.576
They put him in a taco!

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.012
It was horrible.

00:06:20.056 --> 00:06:21.884
Sorry, Poppy.
Creek's gone.

00:06:23.668 --> 00:06:27.324
Poppy, how could you possibly
think Creek's still alive?

00:06:27.367 --> 00:06:28.804
I don't think he's alive.

00:06:28.847 --> 00:06:31.502
I hope he's alive,
and that's enough.

00:06:31.546 --> 00:06:34.026
How do you always look
on the bright side?

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.854
There is no bright side
here. None!

00:06:35.898 --> 00:06:37.465
There's always
a bright side.

00:06:37.508 --> 00:06:39.989
Hey! Where do you think
you're going?

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:41.077
[TROLLS SCREAMING]

00:06:43.688 --> 00:06:46.038
Glitter!
No! Get back in your cage!

00:06:46.082 --> 00:06:47.213
[BRIDGET GRUNTING]

00:06:47.257 --> 00:06:48.345
[TROLLS CLAMORING]

00:06:48.388 --> 00:06:49.694
Chef's gonna be so mad!

00:06:49.738 --> 00:06:51.870
[SCREAMING]No!

00:06:52.871 --> 00:06:54.656
[GRUNTING][YELLS]

00:06:54.699 --> 00:06:57.310
POPPY: Bridget, stop!

00:06:57.354 --> 00:06:59.138
You're in love
with King Gristle.

00:06:59.182 --> 00:07:00.400
[GASPS]

00:07:00.444 --> 00:07:02.185
Um, I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:07:05.231 --> 00:07:07.016
[GASPS] Uh, excuse me!

00:07:07.886 --> 00:07:09.453
That's not mine.

